                                    <div class="am:w-full am:h-24 am:mb-4 am:flex am:items-center am:justify-center">
                                        <img decoding="async" src="https://webfiles.amrita.edu/2025/12/Coimbatore.png" alt="Coimbatore Campus" class="am:h-full am:object-contain" />
                                    </div>
                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Coimbatore Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham's Coimbatore campus started in a hidden village named Ettimadai provides over 120 UG, PG and doctoral programs to a student population of over 12,000 and faculty strength of nearly 1500</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
                                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
