                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Amaravati Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, a leading multidisciplinary and research-intensive university, has established its campus in Amaravati.</p>
