                                    <div class="am:w-full am:h-24 am:mb-4 am:flex am:items-center am:justify-center">
                                        <img decoding="async" src="https://webfiles.amrita.edu/2025/12/Amritapuri.png" alt="Amritapuri Campus" class="am:h-full am:object-contain" />
                                    </div>
                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Amritapuri Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham's Amritapuri campus located in the pleasing village of Vallikavu is a multi-disciplinary research and teaching institute peacefully blended with science and spirituality</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
