                                </a><a href="https://www.amrita.edu/campus/bengaluru/" class="am:group am:block am:relative am:p-5 am:h-full am:transition-all am:duration-300 am:hover:shadow-lg" style="background-color: #f2f8ff;">
                                    <div class="am:w-full am:h-24 am:mb-4 am:flex am:items-center am:justify-center">
                                        <img decoding="async" src="https://webfiles.amrita.edu/2025/12/Bengaluru.png" alt="Bengaluru Campus" class="am:h-full am:object-contain" />
