                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Bengaluru Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham's Bengaluru Campus situated in Junnasandra, Karnataka, aims to create graduates with a solution mindset and a high degree of ethical standards</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
