                                    </div>
                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Faridabad Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">A land that has witnessed the historical prominence of ultra-modern facilities in India. A place where science, technology, and research merge to embrace good health across a 130-acre sprawling health city campus.</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
                                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                </a><a href="https://www.amrita.edu/campus/haridwar/" class="am:group am:block am:relative am:p-5 am:h-full am:transition-all am:duration-300 am:hover:shadow-lg" style="background-color: #eeffee;">
                                    <div class="am:w-full am:h-24 am:mb-4 am:flex am:items-center am:justify-center">
                                        <img decoding="async" src="https://webfiles.amrita.edu/2025/12/Haridwar.png" alt="Haridwar Campus" class="am:h-full am:object-contain" />
                                    </div>
                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Haridwar Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham’s campus in Haridwar, nestled on the sacred banks of the Ganges, is poised to become a landmark of educational excellence. This new campus will embody Amma’s profound vision of “education for life” and her emphasis on compassion-driven research, extending the university’s mission to the spiritual heartland of India.</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
                                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
