                                    <h3 class="am:font-satoshi am:text-lg am:font-medium am:text-black am:mb-2">Kochi Campus</h3>
                                    <p class="am:font-satoshi am:text-sm am:leading-relaxed am:text-gray-600 am:line-clamp-4 am:mb-8 line-clamp-3">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham's Kochi campus is an extensive campus comprising a premier multispeciality hospital, Amrita Institute of Medical Sciences, School of Medicine, Dentistry, Nursing, Pharmacy, Allied Health Sciences, Center for Nanosciences along with a School of Arts and Sciences and Department of Management as well</p>
                                    <div class="am:absolute am:bottom-5 am:left-5 am:text-gray-400 am:group-hover:text-[#AF0C3E] am:group-hover:translate-x-2 am:transition-all">
                                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
