                            </div>
                            <div id="view-about" class="am:w-full am:pb-20">
                                <div class="am:grid am:grid-cols-1 am:md:grid-cols-3 am:gap-15 am:p-8 am:bg-white">
                                    <div class="am:space-y-4 am:md:pr-10 am:md:border-r am:md:border-[#AF0C3E]">
                                                    <h3 class="am:font-anton am:text-2xl am:mb-3 am:text-[#AF0C3E] am:uppercase">About Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham</h3>

                      <p class="am:text-sm am:text-gray-600 am:leading-relaxed">
                        Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a multi-campus, multi-disciplinary research
                        academia that is accredited 'A++' by NAAC and is ranked as one of the best
                        research institutions in India
                      </p>
                                                    <a href="https://www.amrita.edu/about/" class="am:relative am:bg-primary am:font-satoshi am:text-[#AF0C3E] am:rounded-md am:inline-flex am:items-center am:gap-3 am:py-2 am:hover:opacity-90 am:transition am:group">
                                                        <span class="am:w-3 am:h-3">
                                                            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                                                <path d="M0.741882 12.612L12.612 0.741882" stroke="#AF0C3E" stroke-width="1.48377" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                                                <path d="M0.741882 0.741882H12.612V12.612" stroke="#AF0C3E" stroke-width="1.48377" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                                            </svg>
                                                        </span>
                                                        <span>Know More</span>
                                                        <span class="am:absolute am:left-0 am:bottom-0 am:w-0 am:h-[1px] am:bg-[#AF0C3E] am:transition-all am:duration-500 am:group-hover:w-full"></span>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div><div class="am:md:col-span-2 am:grid am:grid-cols-1 am:sm:grid-cols-2 am:md:grid-cols-3 am:gap-10"><div>
                                                                <h6 class="am:text-sm am:font-semibold am:text-gray-900">
