            <p class="am:text-left am:font-satoshi am:mb-8 am:text-gray-300 am:text-sm am:sm:text-base am:font-satoshi am:leading-relaxed am:lg:max-w-lg">Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham is a multi-disciplinary, research-intensive, private university, educating a vibrant student population of over 31,000 by 2150+ strong faculty. Accredited with the highest possible ‘A++’ grade by NAAC, Amrita offers more than 300 UG, PG, and Ph.D. programs across various disciplines, including Engineering, Management, Medical Sciences, Ayurveda, Life Sciences, Physical Sciences, Agricultural Sciences, Law, Arts &#038; Humanities, and Social &#038; Behavioral Sciences.</p>
