                    <img decoding="async" class="am:w-full am:h-full am:object-cover am:transition-transform am:duration-700 am:group-hover:scale-110" src="https://webfiles.amrita.edu/2025/12/home-gallery-image-15.jpg" alt="Life @ Amrita" loading="lazy" />
                    <div class="am:absolute am:inset-0 am:bg-white/90 am:opacity-0 am:group-hover:opacity-100 am:transition-opacity am:duration-300 am:flex am:items-end am:p-4">
                        <p class="am:text-black am:text-sm am:sm:text-base am:font-satoshi am:font-satoshi am:translate-y-4 am:transition-transform am:duration-300 am:group-hover:translate-y-0">A sea of smiles capturing the festive spirit.</p>
                    </div>
